      "title": "Test requester",
      "notation": "test-requester",
      "description": "Asks for a system under test to be certified against a named `test-plan/v1` (plan id and version). It may BE the system under test, or speak for it, and that is exactly why it carries no lane after the request: the requester never tests, checks or certifies, so the system never writes a verdict about itself (`untainted-verification`; the `test-sut-not-self-judged` criterion). Lane `Lane_Requester` in `test-plan-execution.bpmn`, bean `3o5b`.",
